      "filename": "index.md",
      "summary": "This markdown document serves as an index for a collection of 29 PDF documents, last updated in 2025. The documents primarily focus on various aspects of neuroscience, including synaptic threshold mechanisms, neural reorganization during long-term learning, and the role of dopamine. The authors, page counts, and specific topics for each document are listed, providing a comprehensive overview of the collection's content.",
