      "filename": "unknown_npgrj_nn_1525_12631268.md",
      "summary": "This document is a scientific paper by Boyden et al., discussing the use of the algal protein Channelrhodopsin-2 to achieve precise, noninvasive control of specific neuronal populations. The main focus is on the millisecond-timescale optical control of neural activity, a significant objective in systems neuroscience. The document is technical and intended for those interested in advanced neuroscience techniques.",
