    "/home/batesk52/CMU.49.007-Literature-Review/document_summaries/by_type/pdfs/xiao_zhou_rex_n_tien_sadhana_ravikumar_and_steven_m_chase_distinct_types_of_neural_reorganization_during_long-term_learning.md": {
      "file_path": "/home/batesk52/CMU.49.007-Literature-Review/document_summaries/by_type/pdfs/xiao_zhou_rex_n_tien_sadhana_ravikumar_and_steven_m_chase_distinct_types_of_neural_reorganization_during_long-term_learning.md",
