      "filename": "zuzanna_z_balewski_eric_b_knudsen_joni_d_wallis_fast_and_slow_contributions_to_decision_making_in_corticostriatal_circuits.md",
      "summary": "This document, authored by Zuzanna Z. Balewski, Eric B. Knudsen, and Joni D. Wallis, explores the role of corticostriatal circuits in decision-making processes, with a focus on both fast and slow contributions. The authors, from the University of California, Berkeley, delve into the complexities of these processes, providing technical details and research findings within the fields of neuroscience and psychology.",
