      "summary": "This markdown document is a summary of a scientific article by Mohammad Hassan Malekoshoaraie, published in Microsystems & Nanoengineering. The article focuses on the development and potential applications of fully flexible implantable neural probes designed for electrophysiology recording and controlled neurochemical modulation. The document likely includes technical details about the design and functionality of these neural probes.",
