      "summary": "This document is a review article by Javier Lucas-Romero that investigates the spontaneous activity of dorsal horn neurons. It focuses on the patterns and functions of these neurons in both healthy and diseased states. The article, published in the European Journal of Physiology, is intended to provide insights into neuroscience and was last revised in April 2024.",
