      "filename": "mark_m_tonegawa_et_al_-_2018_-_the_role_of_engram_cells_in_the_systems_consolidation_of_memory.md",
      "summary": "The document \"The role of engram cells in the systems consolidation of memory\" by Mark M. Tonegawa et al. is a 35-page scholarly article that delves into the role of engram cells in memory consolidation. The document, sourced from MIT Open Access Articles, provides an in-depth review of the subject, making it pertinent for those interested in neuroscience, particularly the specifics of memory consolidation and engram cells.",
