      "filename": "aaron_c_koralek_temporally_precise_cell-specific_coherence_develops_in_corticostriatal_networks_during_learning.md",
      "summary": "This markdown document provides an overview of a scientific report by Aaron C. Koralek, titled 'Temporally Precise Cell-Specific Coherence Develops in Corticostriatal Networks during Learning'. The report investigates the development of cell-specific coherence in corticostriatal networks during learning, emphasizing the complex relationship between learning and changes in neural networks. The research was conducted at the University of California, Berkeley, and the Champalimau Centre for the Unknown.",
