      "filename": "anne_e_urai_large-scale_neural_recordings_call_for_new_insights_to_link_brain_and_behavior.md",
      "summary": "This markdown document is a summary of a review article by Anne E. Urai and colleagues, focusing on the need for new insights to link brain and behavior in the context of large-scale neural recordings. The document discusses the challenges and potential solutions in interpreting large-scale neural data in neuroscience research. The original research was conducted by a team from various prestigious institutions.",
