      "summary": "This markdown document is a summary of a scientific study titled \"Striatal activity topographically reflects cortical activity\" by Andrew J Peters and colleagues. The study investigates the topographical relationship between cortical and striatal activity, suggesting that the cortex's projections to the dorsal striatum regulate behavior. The document is particularly relevant to those studying neurology and behavior regulation.",
