      "filename": "unknown_buzsáki_et_al_-_2015_-_tools_for_probing_local_circuits_high-density_silicon_probes_combined_with_optogenetics.md",
      "summary": "The document is a detailed exploration of the use of high-density silicon probes and optogenetics as tools for probing local circuits in neuroscience. Authored by Buzsáki et al. in 2015, it delves into the technical aspects of these methodologies and their potential for enhancing our understanding of neural circuits. This document is intended for those interested in advanced neuroscience research techniques.",
